LX_CG_SU         1170 ; mm ! X distance SU CG is behind sprung mass origin [I]
Y_CG_SU             0 ; mm ! Y coordinate of SU CG [I]
M_SU             1600 ; kg ! Mass of unladen sprung mass (SU) [I]
